// Ch1 C1-13: the net-pen hull. The girl from the Reefball pen and two smaller children cling to the
// netting; Rhen gets them onto the plank bridge toward the keel-hull. Habit holding panic together.
title: ch01_net_pen
location: ch01/oruvel
---
// M3-CIN-1235 (PC GPU QA row 58): the field camera had the pen and the child far off-frame; P01 is over Rhen's
// shoulder onto the pen, so the child who calls is in the shot and runs out of it across to the bridge.
// PC GPU QA pass 5, row 58: the children read dark in the storm. Rhen's lantern side keys them (warm, PenKey) and a
// cool rim from the net wall separates them from it (pen_lights).
@light PenKey on
@light PenRim on
@camera P01
Child [afraid]: Rhen! The net's going! #line:ch01_net_pen_001
Rhen [determined]: I know. Hands on the plank. Don't look at the water, look at me. #line:ch01_net_pen_002
@mark pen_child bridge run
Rhen [determined]: Keel-hull. Go, and don't stop for anything. I'm right behind you. #line:ch01_net_pen_003
@light PenKey off 0.5
@light PenRim off 0.5
@camera release
===
